# Test 3d: Pure gauge reference for HMC large mass comparison
# Quenched heatbath at beta=5.6, 4^4 lattice

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 4
nY: 4
nZ: 4
nT: 4

-------------------------------
[Gauge Action]
-------------------------------
Beta: 5.6
Update Method: heatbath
Metropolis Epsilon: 0.2
Start Type: hot

-------------------------------
[Monte Carlo]
-------------------------------
Thermalization Sweeps: 500
Number of Configurations: 100
Sweeps Between Measurements: 10
Overrelaxation Sweeps: 4
Configuration Save Frequency: 50
Save Binary Configs: off
Random Seed: 88888

-------------------------------
[Measurements]
-------------------------------
Measure Wilson Loops: off
Wilson Loop R Max: 2
Wilson Loop T Max: 2
Measure Polyakov: on
Measure Correlators: off
Verbose Output: off

-------------------------------
[Wilson Fermions]
-------------------------------
Kappa: 0.15
Wilson r: 1.0
CG Max Iterations: 1000
CG Tolerance: 1.0e-10
Solver Type: bicgstab

-------------------------------
[HMC]
-------------------------------
MD Steps: 20
MD Step Size: 0.01
HMC Trajectories: 100
